    "detailed_description": "Have you ever saw a sign and thought that it was mondo cool? Ever wanted to learn how to build signs or to simulate the fun of using power tools?<br><br>Or do you just like pixely 3D graphics with horrib---&quot;hyper realistic&quot; physics and the simulation of a real world job? Then look no further! <br><br><strong>Sign Craft: Simulator</strong> is a first-person 3D game that allows you to build your own signs. You start off at a sign shop as an entry level Sign-Technician. In the beginning you complete basic tasks, earning experience which allows your boss to entrust you with more skilled jobs. Includes <i>real-life</i> skill building, such as <u>picking up trash</u> and <u>sweeping</u>!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/86a3b43d0f54d4bae0d60e3496eba99f.webp?t=1746302211\" width=480 height=60 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1746302211\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Utilize equipment such as drop saws and wall saws<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1746302211\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Cut, weld, squeegee and screw materials together to construct signs<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1746302211\" width=32 height=32 /></span>A variety of power and hand tools are at your disposal<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/e33a819a61bd44523065bacd8c8118d2.webp?t=1746302211\" width=32 