height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/ea5e9fd645ab5ff3c75b52ceb15ec700.webm?t=1746302211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633550/extras/ea5e9fd645ab5ff3c75b52ceb15ec700.mp4?t=1746302211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Bored yet? Of course not! There is trash that needs to be picked up. Now go clock in!",
